---
// A depicted Claude chat: an owner changes their Saturday hours in two messages.
// It's a picture of a conversation, not a working chat, so it's one image with a description.
---

<div
  class="chat"
  role="img"
  aria-label="A chat with Claude. You ask: can you change our Saturday hours to 9 to 2? Claude edits two pages, shows the change from Saturday 10am to 4pm to Saturday 9am to 2pm, says it updated the hours on the homepage and the contact page, shows a preview, and asks whether to publish. You reply: yes, publish it. Claude replies: published, your site is live with the new hours."
>
  <div class="head">
    <span class="who">Claude</span>
    <span class="label project">birchwood-bakery</span>
  </div>
  <div class="body">
    <span class="you msg" style="--i: 0">Can you change our Saturday hours to 9–2?</span>
    <div class="claude">
      <span class="tool msg" style="--i: 1">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M8.5 1.5 L10.5 3.5 L4 10 L1.5 10.5 L2 8 Z"></path></svg>
        Edited index.html, contact.html
      </span>
      <div class="diff msg" style="--i: 2">
        <div class="remove"><span aria-hidden="true">−</span><span>Saturday · 10am – 4pm</span></div>
        <div class="add"><span aria-hidden="true">+</span><span>Saturday · 9am – 2pm</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="msg" style="--i: 3">Done. I updated your Saturday hours on the homepage and the contact page. Here’s the preview:</p>
      <div class="preview msg" style="--i: 4">
        <div class="bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span class="url">preview.birchwoodbakery.com</span></div>
        <div class="hours">
          <strong>Hours</strong>
          <div><span>Mon–Fri</span><span>7am – 6pm</span></div>
          <div class="updated"><span>Saturday</span><span>9am – 2pm</span></div>
          <div><span>Sunday</span><span>Closed</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="msg" style="--i: 5">Want me to publish it?</p>
    </div>
    <span class="you msg" style="--i: 6">Yes, publish it.</span>
    <p class="done msg" style="--i: 7">
      <span class="check"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 10 10"><path d="M2 5.2 L4.2 7.4 L8 2.8"></path></svg></span>
      Published. Your site is live with the new hours.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="input">
    <span>Reply to Claude…</span>
    <span class="send"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M6 10 L6 2 M2.5 5.5 L6 2 L9.5 5.5"></path></svg></span>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .chat { flex: 1; border: var(--border-default) solid var(--ink); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--white); overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; color: var(--ink); }
  .head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-3); padding: 0.7rem 1rem; background: var(--paper); border-bottom: var(--border-hairline) solid var(--tint); }
  .who { font-size: 0.9375rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .project { font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .body { padding: var(--space-4); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.9rem; font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .you { align-self: flex-end; max-width: 85%; background: var(--ink); color: var(--on-cobalt); border-radius: 14px 14px 4px 14px; padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem; }
  .claude { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.6rem; }
  .tool { align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; background: var(--paper); border: var(--border-hairline) solid var(--tint); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem; font: 400 0.75rem/1.3 var(--font-mono); color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .tool svg { flex-shrink: 0; fill: none; stroke: var(--ink-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .diff { border: var(--border-hairline) solid var(--tint); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; font: 400 0.78rem/1.6 var(--font-mono); }
  .diff div { display: flex; gap: 0.6rem; padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem; }
  .remove { background: var(--remove-bg); color: var(--remove-ink); }
  .add { background: var(--add-bg); color: var(--add-ink); }
  .preview { border: var(--border-hairline) solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: var(--radius-md); overflow: hidden; }
  .bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem; background: var(--paper); border-bottom: var(--border-hairline) solid var(--tint); font: 400 0.7rem/1.4 var(--font-mono); color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .bar span:not(.url) { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--line); }
  .url { margin-left: 0.4rem; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .hours { padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.2rem; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .hours strong { color: var(--add-ink); }
  .hours div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }
  .hours .updated { background: var(--mint); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem; margin: 0 -0.4rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .done { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .check { width: 1.3rem; height: 1.3rem; flex-shrink: 0; border: var(--border-default) solid var(--ink); border-radius: 50%; background: var(--mint); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .check svg, .send svg { fill: none; stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .check svg { stroke: var(--ink); }
  .input { margin-top: auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem; border-top: var(--border-hairline) solid var(--tint); color: var(--ink-placeholder); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .input span:first-child { flex: 1; }
  .send { width: 30px; height: 30px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cobalt); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .send svg { stroke: var(--on-cobalt); }

  /*
    The conversation plays out once when it scrolls into view (the parent has data-play).
    Paced like a chat rather than a list, so this is the one place messages are spaced 250ms apart.
  */
  :global(.js) [data-play] .msg { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); transition: opacity var(--motion-200) var(--ease-out), transform var(--motion-200) var(--ease-out); transition-delay: calc(var(--i) * 250ms + 150ms); }
  :global(.js) [data-play].is-in .msg { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(.js) [data-play] .msg { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; }
  }
</style>
